# At the hotel in Russian: у меня́ не рабо́тает душ
subtitle: "Check in and complain in Russian: я заброни́ровал но́мер на одного́, ключ, за́втрак включён, and у меня́ не рабо́тает душ."
tags: ["russian","russian hotel","russian travel phrases","у меня не работает","забронировать"]
teaches: ["phrases/travel-phrases"]
thumb: "band \"Your shower is broken. Say it.\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Getting around in Russian: сле́дующая ста́нция","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/93-russian-transport.cast"}

## At the hotel in Russian: у меня́ не рабо́тает душ
level: basic

