A: In a гости́ница you can already ask у вас (@draw q_room@) есть но́мер?, from lesson 47. Today: checking in, and what (@draw shower0@) to say when the shower won't work.
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name hotel w_gost

    erase hotel w_gost q_room shower0

A: This time I booked ahead. Listen: Masha plays the woman at the desk.
    draw bell

A: Здра́вствуйте! Я заброни́ровал но́мер на одного́.
    draw balloon_t caption false

    erase balloon_t

B: Ваш па́спорт, пожа́луйста.
    draw balloon_m caption false

    erase balloon_m

A: Вот он.
    draw balloon_t caption false

    erase balloon_t

B: Спаси́бо. Вот ваш ключ, но́мер пять. За́втрак включён.
    draw balloon_m caption false

    erase balloon_m

    ask "What does the woman at the hotel desk say?" voice b options ["Here's your key: room five. Breakfast is included.","Here's your passport. Room five is taken.","Here's your key: room nine. Breakfast is extra."] correct 1 reveal.text "ключ · 5 · за́втрак включён" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833
        listen: Вот ваш ключ, но́мер пять. За́втрак включён.
        right: Ключ, the key; но́мер пять; and за́втрак включён, breakfast included.
        wrong: Listen for пять, and за́втрак, breakfast, at the end.

    erase question_1_stamp

A: Now with the words: the same four lines.
    draw bell

    erase bell

    draw desk

    draw desk

    draw desk

    draw desk

    erase desk

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: (@draw w_bron w_bron_g@) Заброни́ровал: I booked. It's a past like чита́л, so Masha would (@draw w_bron_f@) say (@highlight w_bron_f color #d4a017 part ла$ effect underline@) заброни́ровала.

    erase w_bron w_bron_f w_bron_g

A: (@draw bed1 w_one@) Но́мер на одного́ is a room for one; (@draw bed2a bed2b w_two@) for two, но́мер на двои́х.

    erase bed1 w_one bed2a bed2b w_two

A: Ключ is the key; за́втрак, the word (@draw coffee w_bfast w_bfast_g@) inside за́втракаю, is breakfast, and включён means included.
    draw key w_key

    erase key w_key coffee w_bfast w_bfast_g

A: And a room is free or taken the way a person (@draw door1 tick w_free@) is: но́мер свобо́ден, но́мер (@draw door2 busy_sign w_busy ends@) за́нят.

    erase door1 tick door2 busy_sign w_free w_busy

A: Room five is nice. Then, in the (@draw shower w_dush@) ва́нная, I turn on the shower: душ.

    erase w_dush

    fade shower to 0.3

A: В ва́нной не рабо́тает душ.
    draw broken w_ne

A: Рабо́тает, said of a thing, means it works; не рабо́тает, it's broken.
    highlight w_ne color #d4a017 part рабо́тает effect underline

    erase w_ne

A: At the desk I say у (@draw w_u@) меня́ не рабо́тает душ: at my place, (@highlight w_u color #d4a017 part "У меня́" effect underline@) in my room, the shower isn't working.

A: And if the TV (@draw phone_x@) is dead too: (@draw w_nich@) ничего́ не рабо́тает! Nothing works.

    erase shower broken w_u phone_x w_nich

    show tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: So I phone the desk. Listen; then tap Practise after the dialogue and take a part.
    draw phone_call

    erase phone_call

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

A: Ничего́ twice, (@draw w_n1 w_n1g@) both from lesson 87: first nothing works, then (@draw w_n2 w_n2g@) ничего́ on its own: never mind, that's fine.

    erase w_n1 w_n1g w_n2 w_n2g

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

    quiz "You're travelling alone. Which room do you ask for?" reveal.text "Но́мер на одного́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: На одного́: for one.
        wrong: Alone means for one: на одного́.
        * Но́мер на двои́х.
        + Но́мер на одного́.
        * Но́мер за́нят.

    erase question_2_stamp

    quiz "The shower in your room is broken. What do you tell the desk?" reveal.text "У меня́ не рабо́тает душ." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Не рабо́тает: it doesn't work.
        wrong: A thing that's broken не рабо́тает.
        * Душ свобо́ден.
        * Где мой душ?
        + У меня́ не рабо́тает душ.

    erase question_3_stamp

    quiz "A woman checks in. What does she say?" reveal.text "Я заброни́ровала но́мер." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Заброни́ровала: a woman, so the а.
        wrong: A woman's past ends in ла, like чита́ла.
        + Я заброни́ровала но́мер.
        * Я заброни́ровал но́мер.
        * Я заброни́ровать но́мер.

    erase question_4_stamp

    ask "Ask the hotel desk whether breakfast is included." say_it "За́втрак включён?" gloss "Is breakfast included?" voice a show cue reveal.text "За́втрак включён?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1

    erase question_5_stamp

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. As a man, type: I booked a room for two." answer ["я забронировал номер на двоих","забронировал номер на двоих","я забронировала номер на двоих","забронировала номер на двоих","я забронировал на двоих номер","я забронировала на двоих номер"] reveal.text "но́мер на двои́х" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Я заброни́ровал, then но́мер на двои́х.
        wrong: Заброни́ровал, I booked; then но́мер на двои́х.

    erase question_6_stamp

A: Я заброни́ровал но́мер на двои́х.
    draw ans_build

    erase ans_build

    group board members ["s1","s2","s3"]

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So at a hotel: я заброни́ровал, на одного́ or на двои́х, the ключ and the за́втрак; and when something (@highlight s3 color #d4a017 effect underline@) breaks, не рабо́тает.
    highlight s1 s2 color #d4a017 effect underline

    erase board

A: Next time: getting around, on the metro and the bus.
